    {
      "id": "bundle:88e3b639ab349decf14142246b79ddbc9b198bac9ba2042f0d8d552fbf7d9e6d",
      "request_id": "88e3b639ab349decf14142246b79ddbc9b198bac9ba2042f0d8d552fbf7d9e6d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "31ebeb2aabf35c2fdf752ca7d53c944a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "小组赛最后一场，对阵科博利。他六比四、六比一过关，三战全胜，一盘未丢，进入半决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c583f34398dced445dec13cbf03aea3a0108f74ff7885ba1e8da39cfc81fdf46",
      "words_sha256": "6a69175d4628fbbcc61a7775761e9890f64d747f0f6520ce29bd540b1c00bfd1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8ec1c8b96a8b3cb7d729807c0ba86802c3c10981f841ca80c15baca0d0ccb08d",
      "request_id": "8ec1c8b96a8b3cb7d729807c0ba86802c3c10981f841ca80c15baca0d0ccb08d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a76442cb4878674dac68482656c2df4e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五场全胜，赛季第六冠、生涯第三十冠。这一周，你最记得半决赛的逆转，还是决赛救回三个盘点？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f835b67f979f22c29943e0532a6faf226aee0a701dc1be8c4f3318961cbd0080",
      "words_sha256": "e1c86648313f98b1e2f68b3bb26a88ee2df4629b599f0a7076446318d3aeed11"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b4dbf15a9c1a89dfaa2c29c39443e44d91b7a77fda0e06aa45925f7781d529cd",
      "request_id": "b4dbf15a9c1a89dfaa2c29c39443e44d91b7a77fda0e06aa45925f7781d529cd",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "76c6143e8559851d4f41306538341956",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛才是真正的苦战。谢尔顿先拿六比三；第二盘四比三，阿尔卡拉斯在对手发球局等到机会。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0f1392bde6f00513d09b774d52e6170abe0829a26a52f0aaa19434307b05e897",
      "words_sha256": "bbf19aca2c7f30580bf4f356ca9f2e9a02a0b6762a2f8e3d531629a8d0ffe656"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b9f2ddec5251f74b230a8582938378b5e8a1c0ea729c34c10be40149fc65292c",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c3864c3e7e131882bbe910cf9077e4bc7be06fb2156edfdd332895abf49c4347",
      "request_id": "c3864c3e7e131882bbe910cf9077e4bc7be06fb2156edfdd332895abf49c4347",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ff6b4b2bea06267123d1ef13596eb4c6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二场遇到梅德韦德夫。阿尔卡拉斯因左腿问题申请医疗暂停，仍以六比二、六比四取胜，两场都没丢盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ac162e99dd1a8a728e6922b8eaeb297c7013032d27fd36b568aaa2d2693b01f2",
      "words_sha256": "7eec49513be5213548c0b5603b4438e937396679d2aaf9e7df3dae7b8082b7c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c8d2c6dfff7cd5bff756ffafa940e75700df90e2600eb215b2819b4f21cd4fb3",
      "request_id": "c8d2c6dfff7cd5bff756ffafa940e75700df90e2600eb215b2819b4f21cd4fb3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2ea0b4f37b8b764c57cfee609560b04a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第三个盘点，兹维列夫在底线相持中回球出界。六比六。阿尔卡拉斯连续救回三个机会，随后又错过第一个冠军点。八比七，第二次机会来到。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "fb4ab918008ddb6bdbc51aad8e101d450e253d0fa10aeec35bdfb9f63b9bd3be",
      "words_sha256": "ea81d02b5b2636ef7b7107ece8762840ee246630ecb8bd90d7e6972aeb94d889"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c96376ce496d038cca75effae9cb1aed44110db55aa7a6516e7c0b7f904cf1c6",
      "request_id": "c96376ce496d038cca75effae9cb1aed44110db55aa7a6516e7c0b7f904cf1c6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "db040aaf24429da3c48800b6fd676ac1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "首盘六比二，第二盘又领先四比二。到了四比三，阿尔卡拉斯发球。兹维列夫拿到了一次机会。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "83a085ef051e04ae192b75b95481b016c4b3fc2e8f3915de6d78c4e42628d090",
      "words_sha256": "fdb044299b338bd4b543403cf7e1ad6e6029b420666132c547b32de5ac552cf8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:cce7a049f11c7d95ec15a79e7954254d26ba8756c06e33a6ac6acb56fde5521d",
      "request_id": "cce7a049f11c7d95ec15a79e7954254d26ba8756c06e33a6ac6acb56fde5521d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7cd3573ede4717bf6555281a1bac52cf",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛对兹维列夫。首盘，阿尔卡拉斯三次拿下对手的发球局。这是四比二时的又一次机会，拿下就能把差距拉到五比二。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "07b7b4e08727b6fb7eab8d28256ed6506ecdc0e4dd956650a5ad62633de95b45",
      "words_sha256": "b5492127d566a01d27bcb4932ce4ced672ed7cfe71ec813a085a8cf39f20691d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d21fee1384f17eaee33a111869d12c004fe5db74d71274cd827ba8fcee376411",
      "request_id": "d21fee1384f17eaee33a111869d12c004fe5db74d71274cd827ba8fcee376411",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d17d9596af0d5d47cd52e904b821cc3d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "底线相持后，谢尔顿回球出界。阿尔卡拉斯第一次破掉他的发球局，五比三，随后六比三扳平。决胜盘打到六比六，最后这轮小分，他只让对手拿到一分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c68cd52826fee8685e9f62cb08dd29fd5a2f0effa60afdf785352325b864b43a",
