        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "北京时间十一月二十三日凌晨，ATP年终总决赛决赛，阿尔卡拉斯六比二、七比六击败兹维列夫，首次捧杯。五场全胜，这座冠军从小组赛开始讲起。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "921e4495425aea2d358f1b9b02fbdc07fa2b9cb0c8da43809f2a7a9b850462a4",
      "words_sha256": "2f5a36b6b068465d9fe5f144613227e194ec387a627744c0d65f7a8ad13d0684"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:da8a3811e8ed69dff9c90e35daab69602a612ac4d0e475392097289734b23d92",
